{"2183670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hotel Galactic", "steam_appid": 2183670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3860260, 3860270, 3860350], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a Home Away from Home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a place where you can just take a breath? Welcome to <strong>Hotel Galactic</strong>! It's a <strong>tale of friendship</strong>, trust, and creating a space where everyone – no matter what corner of the galaxy they come from – feels safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/9bb791b4915e72080e31ce61aa546a8f.poster.avif?t=1784634426\" width=700 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/9bb791b4915e72080e31ce61aa546a8f.webm?t=1784634426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/9bb791b4915e72080e31ce61aa546a8f.mp4?t=1784634426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Settle on the cloud-drifting Island of Imoshima and build a hotel that will become the true <strong>heart of this world</strong>, welcoming travelers from across the endless galaxy. Who knows what story the next guest crossing your threshold will bring?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget about cold spreadsheets or demanding management and <strong>immerse yourself in a warm, magical world</strong> to take a breath and feel truly friendly warmth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Decorate Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of your trusty crew of workers, the island will quickly fill with new rooms. <strong>Design</strong> everything from scratch: <strong>cozy guest bedrooms</strong>, <strong>spacious dining rooms</strong> filled with the smell of delicious food, <strong>game rooms</strong> with arcades, and even a <strong>relaxing spa</strong> with massage tables and a sauna!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/f8e131bcc27460260fc77ed2ce433bed.poster.avif?t=1784634426\" width=700 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/f8e131bcc27460260fc77ed2ce433bed.webm?t=1784634426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/f8e131bcc27460260fc77ed2ce433bed.mp4?t=1784634426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with styles and colors - you have a <strong>whole host of unique furniture and cozy decorations</strong> at your disposal to give the interiors exactly the vibe you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Guests from Across the Galaxy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanderers from all kinds of <strong>fantastic</strong> races will knock on your door. Each of them has their own deep backstory, unique character, and... specific requirements. Win their appreciation by tailoring rooms to their needs. When an object they know so well from their own planet appears in their room, they'll surely feel better right away. Show them heart and hospitality, and they'll share their stories and bonds of friendship with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/cd423ab31a7a8d8d7418707cebaa7b28.poster.avif?t=1784634426\" width=700 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/cd423ab31a7a8d8d7418707cebaa7b28.webm?t=1784634426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/cd423ab31a7a8d8d7418707cebaa7b28.mp4?t=1784634426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Way to the Heart is Through the Stomach</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would a good hotel be without delicious food? <strong>Start a garden</strong>, take care of it, get a <strong>variety of seeds</strong> and grow <strong>cosmic plants</strong> to get ingredients that guarantee the best quality dishes served in the <strong>hotel restaurant</strong>. Cook dishes that will perfectly hit the cosmic palates of your guests, taking into account their culinary preferences. After all, nothing brings people together like a shared, warm meal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/fcf23fca79100d8ea3b4ea784256c702.poster.avif?t=1784634426\" width=700 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/fcf23fca79100d8ea3b4ea784256c702.webm?t=1784634426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/fcf23fca79100d8ea3b4ea784256c702.mp4?t=1784634426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Possibilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>new technologies</strong> that will help you meet hotel challenges. New styles, furniture, decorations, and even <strong>staff uniforms</strong> - it's all at your fingertips thanks to a <strong>network of merchants</strong> who are always ready to help you and provide the necessary <strong>raw materials</strong> or extra hands to work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/3505a42e26abe33806489e74cbdaf9b5.poster.avif?t=1784634426\" width=700 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/3505a42e26abe33806489e74cbdaf9b5.webm?t=1784634426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/3505a42e26abe33806489e74cbdaf9b5.mp4?t=1784634426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a Home Away from Home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a place where you can just take a breath? Welcome to <strong>Hotel Galactic</strong>! It's a <strong>tale of friendship</strong>, trust, and creating a space where everyone – no matter what corner of the galaxy they come from – feels safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/9bb791b4915e72080e31ce61aa546a8f.poster.avif?t=1784634426\" width=700 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183670/extras/9bb791b4915e72080e31ce61aa546a8f.webm?t=17